          <h2>
            <span lang="de">Sag dem Kiebitz, was dir auffällt.</span>
            <span lang="en">Tell Kiebitz what you notice.</span>
            <span lang="fr">Dites à Kiebitz ce que vous remarquez.</span>
            <span lang="es">Cuéntale a Kiebitz lo que veas.</span>
            <span lang="zh">把你注意到的告诉 Kiebitz。</span>
            <span lang="hi">जो आपको दिखे, Kiebitz को बताइए।</span>
